Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个全新的头目登场 她的名字叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is a big new comer.Her name is Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我不会在喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I like you any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体里流淌着恶魔之血 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have got demon blood in me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个全新级别的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am whole new level of freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 她不是露比 是莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! It's not Ruby, its Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可爱们 上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sic him, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该给我放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should show me some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能带你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dragged you out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能再把你扔回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can throw you back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:37.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（43小时之前）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒探员 佩里探员 认识下弗兰克·奥布赖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent tyler, agent perry, meet frank o'brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是因突发心脏病而死的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died of a heart attack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是奥布赖恩才44岁 而且据资料上显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}But o'brien was 44 years old and, according to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是一名马拉松选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}a marathon runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人迟早都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody drops dead sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我为什么要找有安全感的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I got job security.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 如果弗兰克因心脏猝死是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but frank kicked it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那眼下 就在昨天 莫米饭店也有两个完全健康的人猝死于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, just yesterday, two perfectly healthy men bit it in maumee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是突发性心脏病 你不觉得奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All heart attacks. you don't think that's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我看来这是莫米饭店的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like maumee's problem to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么FBI总是要找个垫背的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's the FBI give a damn, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想看看弗兰克的尸检报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to see the results of frank's autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿来的尸检报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}What autopsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上会做的那份\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次现场尸检\N{\fnArial\fs30}First dead body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想靠近它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.19,0:02:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些肌肉都已经僵硬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because these suckers can get pretty ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麻烦你把肋骨钳递给我 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hand me those rib cutters, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是婚戒造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that from a wedding ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不认为弗兰克是已婚人士 - 这我就管不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't think frank was married. - Ain't my department.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得这些是怎么造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea how he got these?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越是垂死挣扎 事实上你死得越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you drop dead, you actually tend to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是挣扎时身体接触地面产生的擦痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body probably got scraped up when it hit the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我没发现任何主动脉阻塞的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i can't find any blockages in any of the major arteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这心脏看起来根本就没有任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart looks pretty damn healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能暂时帮忙拿一下吗 劳驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that a second, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉 那是脾脏液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. spleen juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的警钟 莱纳斯 你看到我的 他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's bells, linus, have you seen my… Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联邦调查局的探员 我 - 你居然让他们这么等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Federal agents. I, uh - And you kept them waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 是你说的别打扰你嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you said not to disturb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来 小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on back, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱鞋先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔·布莱敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al britton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你们 - 我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to meet you. - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我能为萨姆大叔（美国绰号）做些啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for uncle Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们正在调查弗兰克·奥布赖恩一死之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're looking into the death of frank o'brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道是你的人发现了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand some of your men found his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟弗兰克 是挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and frank, we were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 我们俩都是斗鸡队的（迪恩误会成召妓了）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, we were gamecocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们垒球队的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our softball team's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:04:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都强壮的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're majestic animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和弗兰克在高中时就认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew frank since high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我都是到了今天早上才有勇气去看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, I just this morning got up the strength to go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank was…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,诚心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死前 你有没注意到弗兰克有什么奇怪的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he died, did you notice frank acting strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe scared of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常的神经质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real jumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道他究竟害怕什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what scared him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't answer his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 我派了我手下去看看他 结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, i sent some of my boys over to check on him, and, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的你们也都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 联邦调查据干嘛管这些个小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why the feds give a crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会真的认为这里会发生什么大案吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think there's a case here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没什么特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是突发性心脏病罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能是什么突发性心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way that was a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,三名受害者都有相同的红色抓痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three victims, all with those same red scratches,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在48小时之内由紧张到惊恐至死\N{\fnArial\fs30}All went from jittery to terrified to dead within 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有什么吓死了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something scared them to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 什么东西可以做到这一点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西不能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂 吸血鬼 卓柏卡布拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts, vampires, chupacabra?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样的东西多着呢 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It could be a hundred things. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们就得理个清单出来一样一样排除\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we make a list and start crossing things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 最后见到弗兰克·奥布赖恩的人是谁来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who's the last person to see frank o'brien alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他的邻居 马克·哈金森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, his neighbor, mark hutchins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 嘿 - 咋啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on, hey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢看到那些年轻小子聚在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the looks of those teenagers down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's walk this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒和佩里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler and perry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟阿罗史密斯（硬摇滚乐队）一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like aerosmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 世界果真很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你醉后见到弗兰克·奥布赖恩的时间是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the last time you saw frank o'brien?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期一 他正从他家窗户那边望着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monday. he was watching me from his window.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他挥挥手 但他马上就把窗帘拉上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I waved at him, but he just closed the curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼 那你最近有和他交谈过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. did you speak to him recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他看起来有什么不一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he seem different?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 像是很惊恐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 完全正确 他很害怕出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, totally. he was freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道 嗯 你知道他害怕什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know, uh, do you know what scared him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然 女巫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 前些晚上电视里上演了绿野仙踪 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, "wizard of oz" was on tv the other night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后他就说那个绿衣小贱人想要抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said that green bitch was totally out to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他让他害怕的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else scare him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切都让他害怕 象基地组织 侦探 人造糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else scared him, al-qaeda, ferrets, artificial sweetener,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至于那些睁着小眼睛死鱼 反正就是所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those pez dispensers with their dead little eyes, lots of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 弗兰克长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, what was frank like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他死了 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's dead, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想打击他 但他好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i don't want to hammer him, but he got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got better?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在高中时 他算个鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in high school he was… he was a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:07:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,算个鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个傻逼一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他可能被镇上一般的人取笑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he probably taped half the town's butt cheeks together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也包括我在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine included.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他看别人也不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he pissed a lot of people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说可能有人要报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think anyone would have wanted to get revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克有心脏病是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank had a heart attack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答问题 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just answer the question, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 他媳妇出事以后他就好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, he got better after what happened to his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他媳妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他结婚了那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he was married.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她20年前就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died about 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克很受打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank was really broken up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕多尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be scared of donny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你一定得看看的玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's marie you got to look out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像挺害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}She smells fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,郡秘书办公室有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck at the county clerk's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定是否称之为运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I'd call it luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克的老婆 杰西 是个狂躁抑郁症病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank's wife, jessie, was a manic-depressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她1988年离家出走就此渺无音讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went off her meds back in '88 and vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两周后找到了她 在三个村外\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found her two weeks later, three towns over,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,缩在旅馆里 自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strung up in her motel room, suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克没有阻止她什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance frank helped her along to the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 她走的时候弗兰克在值夜班\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, frank was working the swing shift when she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈是完美的不在场证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airtight alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的本子上有什么记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was frank's pad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头到尾看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searched it top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有咒语 没有魔袋 没有白银\N{\fnArial\fs30}No emf, no hex bags, no silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以可能没有鬼魂 没有巫婆 也没有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So probably no ghosts, no witches, no demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,排除三个可能 还有97个\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 down and 97 to go. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你速度快低于20了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you're going 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是速度下限\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the speed limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥 安全行车也犯法啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? safety's a crime now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你要去哪啊 刚才过我们旅馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, where are you going? that was our hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我不会在迎面的车流中左拐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, i'm not gonna make a left-hand turn into oncoming traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有这么话说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I just say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇了怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被附身了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I haunted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 鲍比 继续观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok bobby.keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚和鲍比说过话 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just talked to bobby. and?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, well, you're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,幽灵疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ghost sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,幽灵疾病 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost sickness? yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.27,0:11:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神啊 别 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道这是什么 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what that is. okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些文明相信某些幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some cultures believe that certain spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以感染活着的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can infect the living with a disease, which is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么他们停在在屋里展出尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why they stopped displaying bodies in houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,并把他们从殡仪馆搬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And started taking them off to funeral homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 做点好事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get to the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始有焦虑症状了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symptoms are you get anxious…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 害怕还有 真的害怕 然后你的心就不跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. …and scared, then really scared, then your heart gives out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟悉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是 萨姆 我们几周都没看见一个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, sam, we haven't seen a ghost in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑你被鬼魂感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i doubt you caught it from a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 一旦幽灵感染第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, once a spirit infects that first person,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,幽灵疾病可以通过任何像咳嗽握手之类的行为传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost sickness can spread like any sickness through a cough, a handshake,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同流感一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 弗兰克 奥布莱恩是第一个死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, frank o'brien was the first to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明他也可能是第一个感染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means he was probably the first infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patient zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己找的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our very own outbreak monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你看 弗兰克在莫米酒吧度过周末的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. get this, frank was in maumee over the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,垒球联赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Softball tournament…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里至少感染了两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is where he must have infected the other two victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是战鸡队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they gamecocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉米垃圾队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cornjerkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以鬼魂感染了弗兰克 他传给另外俩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, ghosts infected frank, he passed it on to the other guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又被他尸体感染了 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got it from his corpse? right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在距离我神经失常心跳停止就两天时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now, what, i have 48 hours before I go insane and my heart stops?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真快 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Super. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why me? why not you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你也接触尸液了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you got hit with the spleen juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 鲍比和我研究了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um, you see, bobby and I have a theory about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,原因就是一个病原体会毒害三个受害者 个人体质问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out all three victims shared a certain, uh, personality type.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克是第一个中着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank was a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,另两个受害者 一个副校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other two victims, one was a vice principal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个是保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other was a bouncer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 他们都是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, they were all dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我也是白痴对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying I'm a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个推理不成立\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的三个受害者都因为害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All three victims used fear as a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这种疾病开始回报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now this disease is just returning the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有吓唬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't scare people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们做的都是在吓唬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, all we do is scare people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所以你也是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then, you're a dick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 不管怎样 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, i'm not. whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们解决掉传染源的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gank the ghost that started all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 这种病就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do that, the disease should clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说弗兰克的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking frank's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她为什么自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows why she killed herself, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing waiting out here, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们房间在4楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our room's on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很 很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's high.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去试试换底楼的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see if I can move us down to the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有发现么 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find anything? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 奥布莱恩的遗体已经烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie o'brien's body was cremated,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常确定她不是我们要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm pretty sure she is not our ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit picking at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 觉得如何 - 感觉好极\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you feeling? - Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次做砧板上的鱼肉的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to have my head on the chopping block again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快忘了这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot what that feels like. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真妈的爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freaking delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们忽略的最大的线索 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been completely ignoring the biggest clue we have, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想当线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,擦痕 这个瘟疫要告诉我们一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The abrasions, this, the disease, it's trying to tell us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们什么 小木块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what, wood chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要增援 你是唯一在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need backup, and you're all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going in, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点让人毛骨悚然吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a little spooky, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i'm not carrying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,会走火\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:16:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll man the flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:16:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,感应器不会和我在一起就有反映了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emf's not gonna work with me around, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,给弗兰克 爱你的 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}"to frank. love, jessie."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank o'brien's ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was frank doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟 加兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther garland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是弗兰克的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is frank's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plot thickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.33,0:19:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But into what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来对地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we got the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝醉了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he…drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,副警官 根据这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy, according to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟 加兰死于精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther garland's cause of death was physical trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:21:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个死于20年前我还没出生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy died 20 years ago, before my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以和警长谈谈么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then can we talk to the sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天病假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, he's out sick today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你看到他让他给我们电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you see him, will you have him call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住在蓝鸟酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're staying at the bluebird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拿这个么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I take this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, y-you too, i guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, uh, those FBI guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟 加兰的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}A file, luther garland's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.77,0:22:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你做了什么 他们是来讨债的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what you did, and they're gonna make you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是躲不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警徽是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, these badges are fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们被发现怎么办 我们要坐牢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we get busted? we could go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, shh! calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep breath, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.57,0:22:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,加兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. garland.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.33,0:22:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是泰勒探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. um, i'm agent tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是佩里探员 联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is agent perry, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要问你些关于你兄弟的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to ask you a few questions about your brother luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示你们的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see some i.d.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.23,0:23:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.87,0:23:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会假冒联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who would pretend to be an FBI agent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just nutty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.10,0:23:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.17,0:23:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你兄弟死于精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, your brother luther died of physical trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不同意这个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.53,0:23:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what would you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用在意一个老人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter what an old man thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.17,0:23:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,加兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. garland…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想搞清你兄弟的死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just trying to get the truth on your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.83,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.90,0:23:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人看到卢瑟都怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody was scared of luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.70,0:23:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫他怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called him a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太个子大了 又张的凶恶的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was too big, too mean-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.63,0:24:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一样的大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.87,0:24:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他有多善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't matter he was the kindest man I ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他是否有没有伤害过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't matter he'd never hurt no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.80,0:24:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人辜负过卢瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people failed luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.73,0:24:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了老婆还带着三个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a widower with three young'uns,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.61,0:24:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以告诉自己我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I told myself there was nothing I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.97,0:24:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,加兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. garland, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.13,0:24:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recognize this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西·奥布赖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's jessie o'brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.47,0:24:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她丈夫弗兰克 杀了卢瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her man, frank, killed luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.27,0:24:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.83,0:24:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.67,0:24:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是没说罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just don't talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西是工厂里的接待员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessie was a receptionist at the mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.57,0:25:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对卢瑟很好 所以卢瑟暗恋过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was always real nice to luther, and he had a crush on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而弗兰克对这点耿耿于怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But frank didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.67,0:25:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当杰西失踪时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when jessie went missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.32,0:25:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克深信是卢瑟干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank was sure that luther had done something to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.67,0:25:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果她是自杀的 但弗兰克不知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out the old gal killed herself, but frank didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.93,0:25:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟被发现时铁链正缠着他的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found luther with a chain wrapped around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.23,0:26:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被工厂外的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dragged up and down the stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉上拉下直到他死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside that plant till he was past dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥布莱恩就没被逮捕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And o'brien was never arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.57,0:26:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向镇上的每位警官报告过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screamed to every cop in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.27,0:26:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不想调查弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't want to look into frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.07,0:26:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是社会的栋梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a pillar of the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.50,0:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我兄弟却是镇上的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother was just the town freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.67,0:26:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很恨弗兰克·奥布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have hated frank o'brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.40,0:26:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨了很久 但对于憎恨来说生命远短的多 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did for a long time, but life's too short for hate, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.53,0:26:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克只是一下子迷茫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And frank wasn't thinking straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.97,0:26:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老婆失踪了 他被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife had vanished. he was terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.47,0:26:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想让卢瑟尝尝同样的耻辱 但那份恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A damn shame he had to put luther through the same, but…that's fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,连绵不绝的传播开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It spreads and spreads.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.23,0:26:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们知道这些是什么了 路疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know what these are, road rash,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.32,0:26:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜当卢瑟被拖曳在路上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm guessing luther swallowed some wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.69,0:26:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还吞了些木屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chips when he was being dragged down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正慢速经历着他的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're experiencing his death in slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.33,0:26:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还不够慢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, not slow enough, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:26:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把他的骨头烧了 我就恢复健康了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say we burn some bones and get me healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.47,0:27:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 事情没这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it won't be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. it'll be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't it be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.87,0:27:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟可是在马路上被拖曳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther was road-hauled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的尸体被磨成碎块\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body was ripped to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.77,0:27:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,散布在马路上的各个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was probably scattered all over that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.70,0:27:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能找到所有残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we're gonna find all the remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.47,0:27:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们只能从其他地方入手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we'll just have to figure something else out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.83,0:27:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么 去它妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? screw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.53,0:27:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.63,0:27:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 我说真的 得了吧萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. no, i mean, come on, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.50,0:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做什么呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.63,0:27:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在猎鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunting a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.43,0:27:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼 确切说到底谁在猎鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost, exactly. who does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.43,0:27:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.97,0:27:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us? right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.63,0:27:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 那就是为什么我们生活一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, sam, that is exactly why our lives suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.63,0:27:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 这就是为什么我们的生活这么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, sam, that is exactly why our lives suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.77,0:27:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 我们猎的是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. we hunt monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.77,0:27:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我们抓妖怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. we hunt monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.67,0:27:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么事呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.67,0:27:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.97,0:27:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常人看见怪物拔腿就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, normal people, they see a monster, and they run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.97,0:27:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 正常人 看到妖怪就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, normal people, they see a monster, and they run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.07,0:27:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们咧 我们还要去找那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not us. No, no, no. We… we search out things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.35,0:27:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀掉我们的鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that want to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就是要活吃了我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? huh? or eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁才会干这事吗 神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who does that? crazy people!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.10,0:27:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}We…are insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.80,0:27:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:27:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去吃那些恶心的东西 睡那些脏兮兮的汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's the bad diner food and then the skeevy motel rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.81,0:28:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去见那些长了些奇奇怪怪的疹子的载货车停车场女侍应\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the truck-stop waitress with the bizarre rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.13,0:28:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 谁想这样过日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who wants this life, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.13,0:28:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的喜欢一天8个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you actually like being stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.26,0:28:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起关在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a car with me eight hours a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.05,0:28:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single day?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.13,0:28:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得这有什么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.30,0:28:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i drive too fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.39,0:28:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直不断的重复听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I listen to the same five albums.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.33,0:28:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,5张专辑还喜欢一个人独展歌喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over and over again, a-and I sing along.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.67,0:28:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很讨人厌 我自己都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm annoying.i know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.07,0:28:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 你总是夸夸其谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you… you're gassy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了半个墨西哥玉米煎饼 你也中毒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you eat half a burrito, and you get toxic!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.37,0:28:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白么\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.63,0:28:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以忘掉一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.73,0:28:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoa, dean.where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.60,0:28:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点 萨姆 好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay away from m sam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.50,0:28:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经搞定这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause I am done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定那些魔鬼们 还有那些个地狱犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm done with the monsters and… and… and the hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.60,0:28:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,幽灵疾病和操蛋的天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the ghost sickness and the damn apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.97,0:28:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我功成名就了 闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm out. i'm done.quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.80,0:29:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处在找你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}i looked everywhere for you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.10,0:29:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the hell did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.80,0:29:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.63,0:29:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有不到4小时的命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i got less than four hours on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm gonna die, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.53,0:29:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又得回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.37,0:29:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}back?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.40,0:29:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,底下的地狱 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}downstairs, dean hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.17,0:29:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是祸不单行\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's about damn time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.47,0:29:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.03,0:29:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是弄疼我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been a real pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.50,0:29:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.70,0:29:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快从我弟弟的身体里滚出来 你这狗娘养的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get out of my brother, you evil son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.50,0:30:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有谁可以附身于我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one's possessing me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.73,0:30:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的终极形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what i'm going to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是我想要成为的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what I want to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.37,0:30:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, hey, hey, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.63,0:30:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨嗨嗨 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, dean. dean. dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.00,0:30:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}howdy, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.90,0:30:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.40,0:30:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你那么快就赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, thanks for coming so quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.93,0:30:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where's dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.13,0:30:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}home sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.20,0:30:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不起什么作用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this isn't helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.53,0:30:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始有幻觉了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, have his hallucinations started yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.06,0:31:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时以前开始有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a few hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.26,0:31:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.63,0:31:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大概是周一上午8点见的验尸官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw the coroner about 8:00 a.m. monday morning, so, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.01,0:31:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以只有不到两个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just under two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.83,0:31:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.60,0:31:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本江户时代的幽灵百科全书\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, uh, encyclopedia of spirits dates to the edo period.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.10,0:31:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能读懂日文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can read japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是 而且还会卖弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess so, show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 这本书里有我们要找的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, this book lists a kind of ghost that could be our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.73,0:31:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种幽灵能让人得恐惧病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, uh, infects people with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.76,0:31:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字叫 buruburu\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a buruburu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,书上说怎么除掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It say how to kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以往一样 用火烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as usual, burn the remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.63,0:31:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 还有别的办法么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful. Uh…is there a plan "b"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.50,0:31:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毛病因恐惧而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the buruburu is born of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 应该说它就是恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, it is fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上讲应该能用恐惧除掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the lore says we can kill it with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是说我们得把它吓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have to scare a ghost to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.33,0:31:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell we gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.76,0:32:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在忍一会儿 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, just ride out the trip, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.43,0:32:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 我们有办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're… you're gonna be fine. we got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.76,0:32:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之是个好办法 你等着就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just a good plan, all right? hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划可真糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a terrible plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.56,0:32:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 糟在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.90,0:32:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我说过 把幽灵吓死 但这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I said, "scare the ghost to death, " but this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.33,0:32:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有更好的办法 现在告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea, I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.33,0:33:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.33,0:33:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么要调查卢瑟·加兰的死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking into luther garland's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.23,0:33:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, you're… you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.86,0:33:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你病了 知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick. you're sick, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.66,0:33:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就和我一样 你得放松点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… just like me, okay? you got to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克是我的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank o'brien was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.60,0:33:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做错了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.93,0:33:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I didn't bust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.30,0:33:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.63,0:33:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把我也抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna bring me down over that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.80,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.63,0:34:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.53,0:34:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得冷静下来 - 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Al, you got to calm down! - Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.86,0:34:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.26,0:34:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.13,0:34:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's wrong, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.90,0:34:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次它直冲我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time he came right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.40,0:34:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost like he's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.66,0:35:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.43,0:35:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.96,0:35:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我得激怒它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I got to make him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.10,0:35:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 卢瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, luther!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.46,0:35:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟 你小子在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, luther! where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.23,0:35:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.60,0:35:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.00,0:36:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.31,0:36:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我 莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.71,0:36:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.65,0:36:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.45,0:36:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you are not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.38,0:36:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.81,0:36:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不记得下面的感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember all the fun you had down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.21,0:36:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.18,0:36:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地狱里4个月就像40年一样难熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}4 months is like 40 years in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.11,0:36:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,度日如年 百般煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like doggy years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一秒你都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you remember every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.85,0:37:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.35,0:37:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.71,0:37:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你依然会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.98,0:37:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然会受到折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still gonna burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.25,0:37:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.51,0:37:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我受到感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd I get infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.78,0:37:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.95,0:37:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听自己的心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.75,0:37:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.31,0:38:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 快开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, punch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.88,0:39:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们开车用铁链拖死鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys rode of ghosts with a chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.61,0:39:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刻着咒语的铁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron chain etched with a spell word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.98,0:39:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前可真没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. now, that's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.61,0:39:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是它最害怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was what he was most afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.21,0:39:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实也非常残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty brutal, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.61,0:39:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我还活着 我们还在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the upside, I'm still alive, so, uh, go, team.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.68,0:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. how you feeling, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.58,0:39:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure, dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.91,0:39:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这行可能会相当吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause this line of work can get awful scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.61,0:39:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.58,0:39:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想去抓鬼么 我想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go hunting? I'll hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.34,0:39:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀掉任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.78,0:39:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw. he's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.71,0:39:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.34,0:39:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys drive safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:39:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.38,0:40:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.74,0:40:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.11,0:40:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.54,0:40:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 最后的那会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near the end, i mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.08,0:40:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一个警察打我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, besides a cop beating my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.78,0:40:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.58,0:40:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多烦死人的猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howler monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.94,0:40:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个屋子都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole roomful of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.71,0:40:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从我身体里爬出来 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those things creep the hell out of me. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.88,0:40:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是些很平常的东西 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, just the usual stuff, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.44,0:40:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right!
